  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SMA Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SAM wants to increase its income by further enhancing its land capital of 50 ha located near the Foum Gleyta dam, through an additional development of 30 ha for a more profitable and secure agricultural operation; the establishment of infrastructure and equipment preservation, processing and storage adapted to market garden, dairy and meat products; the purchase of transport equipment adapted to the products; the establishment of a revolving fund for the purchase of agricultural and veterinary inputs, labor, operation; and support for the project through technical assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
